00:47:21.110 --> 00:47:25.653
and universe, probably
will be the last, you know?

00:47:26.870 --> 00:47:31.500
No legacies of like, you know,
bonjour, who do you support?

00:47:31.500 --> 00:47:35.440
So, you know, so I'm not
